        <profile name="Seed Spore Mines" id="fd87-6c01-a9f5-2374" hidden="false" page="112" publicationId="7150-5917-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This unit can perform the following action:

Seed Spore Mines (Action): At the start of your Shooting phase, one BIOVORES unit from your army can start to perform this action. The action is completed at the end of that phase. When it is completed, set up a new friendly SPORE MINES unit on the battlefield more than 6&quot; away from any enemy units and wholly within 48&quot; of this unit. That SPORE MINES unit contains D3 models for each BIOVORES model in this unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
