        <profile name="Psychic Overload" id="17ce-9710-1b84-6205" hidden="false" page="103" publicationId="7150-5917-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this model successfully manifests a psychic power or completes a psychic action, if the result of the Psychic test was 7 or more, after resolving that psychic power, the closest enemy unit within 12&quot; suffers the number of mortal wounds shown in the table below.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
