        <profile name="Encephalic Diffusion" id="a3e8-4a4a-48d9-8ad7" hidden="false" page="103" publicationId="7150-5917-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This unit can attempt to perform the following psychic action:

Encephalic Diffusion (Psychic Action - Warp Charge 6): In your Psychic phase, this PSYKER can attempt to perform this psychic action. If completed, until the start of your next Psychic phase, this PSYKER gains the following ability:

Diffusion Field (Aura): While a friendly &lt;HIVE FLEET&gt; unit is within 6&quot; of this PSYKER, each time a ranged attack is made against that unit, subtract 1 from the Strength characteristic of that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
