          <conditions>
            <condition childId="ed98-6a58-e87d-0c0d" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="roster" shared="true" type="atLeast" value="1"/>
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Floating Death (Meiotic Spores)" id="2732-3c0c-43be-ad67" hidden="false" page="218" publicationId="7573-8d1b-acdf-2de8" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of the charge phase, if a model in this unit is within 3&quot; of any enemy units, it explodes. Each time a Meiotic Spore explodes, roll one D6; on a 2-3, the closest enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds. On a 4+, the closest enemy unit suffers 3 mortal wounds. That Meiotic Spore model is then destroyed.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Living Bombs (Meiotic Spores)" id="ccb7-3521-45ac-7e07" hidden="false" page="218" publicationId="7573-8d1b-acdf-2de8" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This unit automatically passes Morale tests. Furthermore, this unit is discounted for the purposes of any victory conditions - they never award victory points and do not count towards the number of models controlling an objective.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Float Down (Meiotic Spores)" id="9870-0754-73bb-0ec3" hidden="false" page="218" publicationId="7573-8d1b-acdf-2de8" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">During deployment, you can set up this unit in the upper atmosphere instead of on the battlefield. If you do, then in the Reinforcements step of your Movement phase you can set up this unit anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 9&quot; away from any enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
