          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem before the battle, when you are mustering your army. Select one CRUSHER STAMPEDE TYRANID WARRIORS unit from your army. Models in that unit have a Weapon Skill characteristic of 2+ and a Ballistic Skill characteristic of 3+. You can only use this Stratagem once, unless you are playing a Strike Force battle (in which case, you can use this Stratagem twice) or an Onslaught battle (in which case, you can use this Stratagem three times).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
