              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In the Reinforcements step of your opponent&apos;s Movement phase, each time an enemy unit is set up as Reinforcements within 18&quot; of the bearer, you can select one friendly LEVIATHAN CORE or LEVIATHAN CHARACTER unit within 6&quot; of the bearer. If you do so, that friendly unit can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, but its models can only target that enemy Reinforcements unit. A unit cannot be selected to fire more than once per phase as a result of this Relic.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="The Maw-claws of Thyrax" id="b3c9-1518-d0bd-68a8" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="1030-a9c5-ece4-277d" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
