                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of your Movement phase, select one enemy unit within 12&quot; of the bearer and roll 3D6; if the result is equal to or higher than that enemy unit&apos;s Leadership characteristic, until the start of your next Movement phase, that unit cannot perform actions (if that unit is currently performing an action, it immediately fails).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
