              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one enemy unit within Synaptic Link range (pg 87) of the bearer. Until the start of your next Command phase:
• Each time a model in that unit makes an attack, the hit roll cannot be re-rolled and the wound roll cannot be re-rolled.
