                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">• This WARLORD has the Objective Secured ability.
• This WARLORD counts as 5 models when determining control of an objective marker.
• This WARLORD can start to perform an action, even if it Advanced or Fell Back this turn.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
