                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the Command phase, this WARLORD can regenerate itself. If it does so, it regains up to D3 lost wounds. This WARLORD can only regenerate itself once per turn.</characteristic>
