                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly CRUSHER STAMPEDE MONSTER unit is within 6&quot; of this WARLORD, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, an unmodified hit roll of 6 scores 1 additional hit.</characteristic>
